{"id":407,"name":"roserade","speciesId":407,"dex":407,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["grass","poison"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":70,"defense":65,"special-attack":125,"special-defense":105,"speed":90},"abilities":[{"name":"natural-cure","hidden":false},{"name":"poison-point","hidden":false},{"name":"technician","hidden":true}],"height":9,"weight":145,"baseExp":232,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/407.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/407.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/407.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/407.ogg","genus":"Bouquet Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms."},{"version":"pearl","text":"With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."},{"version":"sword","text":"After captivating opponents with its sweet scent, it lashes them with its thorny whips."},{"version":"shield","text":"The poison in its right hand is quick acting. The poison in its left hand is slow acting. Both are life threatening."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Hidden within the bouquet on each hand are thorned whips loaded with virulent poison. Roserade moves gracefully as it corners its prey and mercilessly lashes them with its whips."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups